arding encryption of sensitive data, our do not have information on our capabilities to encrypt sensitive data. As for explicability of AI recommendations and no automated decision without explicit agent validation, our company context mentions that our have a policy of no automated decision without human validation. our monitor typical legal risks including open-source licence compliance and cross-border data flow, but since our operate intra-EU only, cross-border data flow is noted as not being an issue. our do not have information on whether our comply with all the specified regulatory requirements, particularly regarding encryption of sensitive data and explicability of AI recommendations, as information on whether we comply with all the specified regulatory requirements, particularly regarding encryption of sensitive data and explicability of AI recommendations is not present in our company context." ;
